WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Ryu reaches for a throw while Ed is outside its range.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.200
Standing heavy punch punishes the whiffed throw.

3
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.800
Crouching medium kick links from the Punish Counter.

4
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.850
Heavy Psycho Blitz catches the Chaser launch.

5
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.250
Ryu falls at the end of the whiff-punish route.
